&P223455 = TIM 09, 072 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. u2#-zu-um i-la-ka ri-ma-ni 
#tr.ts: uzzum illaka rīmāni 
#tr.en: Anger goes like a wild bull, 
2. [usz]-ta#-na-hi-t,a3-am 
#tr.ts: uštanaḫḫiṭam 
#tr.en: it constantly leaps forth 
3. ka#-al#-ba-ni 
#tr.ts: kalbāni 
#tr.en: like a dog; 
