3. i-na s,e-ri-ka 
#tr.ts: ina ṣērika 
#tr.en: over you 
4. ki-ma szu-mu-nim 
#tr.ts: kīma šummunim 
#tr.en: like a š.-rope, 
5. lu#-ne2#-'i#! ki-bi-is2-ka 
#tr.ts: lune’i kibiska 
#tr.en: I will repel your footsteps. 
6. lu-sze-s,i2 i-sza-tam 
#tr.ts: lušeṣi išatam 
