#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
$ beginning broken 
1.a'. [...] x x x 
#tr.en: ... 
1.b'. [...]-x# sza SZI-x-u2 
2.a'. [...] szu du7 nam-he2 he2-gal2-la bulug3-ga2 
#tr.en: Perfect ..., growing in plenty and abundance, 
2.b'. _[...] ir-bu-u2_ 
3'. [...]-DU i3-sag ga-sag-ga2 e3-a 
#tr.en: ... highest quality ghee and cheese issuing forth, 
4.a'. [...] IGI#-DU# nun-e-ne bara2 ku3 bara2 nun-e du7-a 
#tr.en: ... foremost of princes, prince fit for the holy and princely dais, 
4.b'. _[...] sza-a-u#?_ 
5'. [... {d}nu-musz]-da# igesztu nun-e-ne bara2 ku3 bara2 nun-e du7-a 
#tr.en: Numušda(?), the foremost of princes, prince fit for the holy and princely dais; 
6'. [ki]-ru-gu2 1(disz)-kam-ma 
#tr.en: It is the 1st kirugu. 
7'. [{d}en]-lil2# en {d}nu-nam-nir-re ki-ur3 ki gal-la 
#tr.en: Enlil, lord Nunamnir in Ki'ur, in the great place, 
8'. [...] mu#-ri-in-sa4 mi-ri-in-mah-e 
#tr.en: ... he named you and made it great for you, 
9'. [...] nam gal mu-ri-[in]-tar# 
