#tr.ts: waradkama 
#tr.en: your servant: 
5. te-re-tim a-na szu-lum 
#tr.ts: têrētim ana šulum 
#tr.en: the omens about the well-being 
6. _dumu-mesz_ szi-ip-ri 
#tr.ts: mārī šiprī 
#tr.en: of the messengers 
7. e-pu-usz2-ma la-ap-ta 
#tr.ts: epušma laptā 
#tr.en: I did, and they are not favorable. 
8. a-ta-ar e-pe2-es3-su2-nu-szi-ma 
#tr.ts: atâr eppessunūšima 
#tr.en: I will again do for them. 
