#tr.ts: mimma sagbû 
#tr.en: no patrols 
4. u2-ul sza-ak-nu 
#tr.ts: ul šaknū 
#tr.en: are installed. 
5. u3 ne2-ke-me2-tum ma-la 
#tr.ts: u nēkemētum mala 
#tr.en: And the stunted parts, whatever 
6. i-na ni-qi2 be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ina nīqī bēliya 
#tr.en: in the offerings of my lord 
7. im-ta-na-qu2-ta 
#tr.ts: imtanaqqutā 
#tr.en: are always showing up, 
8. be-li2-ma i-di 
#tr.ts: bēlīma īde 
#tr.en: my lord too knows. 
9. a-na sa-ag-bi a-hu-um na-di 
#tr.ts: ana sagbî aḫum nadi 
#tr.en: As for the patrols, one has become negligent. 
10. u3 te-re-et ne2-pi2-isz-ti 
#tr.ts: têrēt nēpištī 
#tr.en: And the omens of the extispicies 
11. sza# szu-lum ha-al-s,i2-szu-nu 
#tr.ts: ša šulum ḫalṣīšunu 
#tr.en: of the well-being of their districts 
12. [la-ap]-ta 
