&P308083 = YBC 07094
#atf: lang sux
@tablet
@obverse
1. en me {gesz-tug2}gesztu su3# [...]
#tr.en: Lord of the power of profound wisdom ...
2. me sag-kesze2 ur4#-ur4#-re#
#tr.en: Who cares for and collects the powers ...
3. di-ku5 sza3-ge pa3#-de3# x [x x x]
#tr.en: Judge, chosen by the heart of ...
4. esz-bar-ra kin# [x] x x x nam ma-tar
#tr.en: Who makes decisions, ... decides fates for me.
5. ulu3{+lu} za3-du nu-tuku-a ib2?#-bi?# du11-ga
#tr.en: A tempest that has no equal, that speaks with rage
6. inim-bi nu-sa-sa
#tr.en: Whose words are not swept away
7. szul ur#-sag# ni2-gal e2-ri-a
#tr.en: The young man, the hero, clad in splendour
8. [x] x [x] szu? na ke4
#tr.en: ...
9. i#-lim u4-gal2 sag gi6-ga la-la-[(-bi)]
#tr.en: Is he not the illuminating radience, the luxurience of the black-headed,
10. un zi-gal2 u2-a lu-lu nu-lah4?
#tr.en: The provider for the people and the living, no matter how numerous they be?
11. {d}sze3-ri5-da# nin gal me# husz-a mi2 zi-de3-esz du11-ga
#tr.en: Szerida, the great lady who takes care of the awesome powers
12. ul hi-li sag-bi guru3
#tr.en: Its top bearing joy and allure
13. iri an-sze3 sa2 bad3-bi nam-sza6-ga szu du7-a
#tr.en: The city that streches to heaven, its wall being perfect with beauty,
14. lum-lum gibil4 he2-du7
#tr.en: Is an adornment of new luxurience.
15. dam gal ki-ag2 ur-sag szul {d?}utu?# (x)
#tr.en: The great spouse, the beloved of the hero, young man, Utu,
16. x ku3-zu# x x x x x x
#tr.en: Your pure ...
17. sza3-kusz2-u3-bi su3-ra2
#tr.en: Whose counsel is profound.
$ large space
@reverse
1. [x] x x ku3?-ga?
#tr.en: ... pure ...
2. [x x] x mah-bi im-sig
#tr.en: ... the lofty brought low
3. [x x] x-ni na-me nu-gub-bu
#tr.en: None could withstand ...
4. [x x]-da nu-sze um-szi-gub-be2 sahar?-ra? szubtu6! an?# di?# li?#
#tr.en: For the disobedient who would stand by ... a trap in the dust.
5. szubtu6! hul-bi gar-ra
#tr.en: Place an evil trap!

