#tr.ts: ana ṣēriya kušdam 
#tr.en: to me come. 
3. u3 _lu2-tur_-ka la-mi-ka li-bu-am 
#tr.ts: u ṣuḫārka lamika libû’am 
#tr.en: Further, let your servant before you go along, 
4. li-ih-mu-t,a3-am-ma ki-ma a-na pa-ni-ka 
#tr.ts: liḫmuṭamma kīma ana pānika 
#tr.en: let him be quick, so that to you 
