#tr.ts: tušamšima ina madarayama 
#tr.en: you spent the night, but in Madaraya 
8. ta-ab-ti-it sze-rum sze-ra-am-ma 
#tr.ts: tabtīt šērum šēramma 
#tr.en: housed, as early as possible 
9. al-kam u3 _lu2-tur_-ka 
#tr.ts: alkam u ṣuḫārka 
#tr.en: come, and your servant 
10. li#-bu-am-ma a-ia-szi-im 
#tr.ts: libû’amma ayâšim 
#tr.en: let go along, and just me 
11. li-ba-ar-re-e-em 
#tr.ts: libarrêm 
#tr.en: let him notify. 
12. ki-ma a-na a-lim 
#tr.ts: kīma ana ālim 
#tr.en: When the city 
13. a-sa-an-ni-qu2 
#tr.ts: asanniqu 
#tr.en: I approach, 
14. u3 _dingir-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: u ilū 
#tr.en: and the gods 
@left 
