&P346164 = CDLI Literary 000395, ex. 017
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a2 sed4-de3-[...] 
#tr.en: Therefore shall relax towards its “cool side” 
2. [...] har-ra-an-na DU#? [...] 
