23. KA ku3-ga-ne-ne-a szu ha-ra-mu2-mu2-ne 
#tr.en: They shall pray for you with their holy words/mouths 
24. {d}ri-im-{d}suen lugal-gu10 
#tr.en: Rīm-Sîn, my king 
25. 4(u) 6(disz) mu-bi-im 
