3. [...]-ra#?-bi! masz kar#-ra-gin7 tesz2-e im-me-e-da 
#tr.en: Its fugitivies left(?) together(?) like fleeing goats 
4. [...]-es#{ki#} ga-gin7 ur-e# ba-an-de2 i3-gul-gul-lu-de3 
