$ blank space 
18'. {d}en-lil2-le dumu-ni {d}suen-ra inim zi mu-un-na-ab-be2 
#tr.en: Enlil was speaking a true word to his son Suen 
19'. dumu-gu10 iri nam-he2 giri17-zal sza-ra-da-du bala-zu ba-szi-ib-kin2!? 
