&P346227 = CDLI Literary 000383, ex. 001
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. iri me nun-na a gal-la diri-ga a-e ba-da-ri x x [...] 
#tr.en: The city of the princely me floating in the flood water was set/sailed upstream(?) in the water ... 
