10'. gi4-me-a-asz-zu-ne nu-ra-ab-lib4-lib4-e-ne ur5-da nir ba-e-gal2 
#tr.en: Your colleagues do not attack(?) against(?) you and therefore you were confident 
11'. ni2-zu!-a sag-ki# la-ba-e-ni-gar 
