12'. dub2-dub2-bu lu2-ra gig hul gig gi4-me-a-asz-e-ne 
#tr.en: Insulting(?), hurtful(?) to another person, hated by his colleagues(?) 
13'. lu2 nig2 hul-dim2-ma sa-hir lu2-erim2-ma 
