23. gu7-gu7-zu-usz# lu2 sze gesz# [...] 
#tr.en: Do not have someone thresh the barley for your eating(?) 
24. sze# zar#?-ra ne#-[...] 
#tr.en: Give your barley sheaves a rest 
25. siskur2# [...] 
