#tr.ts: ina bārtim 
#tr.en: in rebellion 
10. i-la-at-ta-ku-ka 
#tr.ts: ilattakūka 
#tr.en: they will test you. 
11. pa-ga-ar-ka u2-s,u2-ur 
#tr.ts: pagarka uṣur 
