8. _igi_ i-bi-{d}nin-szubur 
#tr.ts: maḫar i(b)bi-ilabrat
#tr.en: Before Ibbi-ilabrat (and)
9. _igi_ i-din-{d}nin-szubur _dumu-me_ nu-ur2-a-li-szu 
#tr.ts: maḫar i(d)din-ilabrat mārī nūr-alīšu
#tr.en: before Iddin-ilabrat, sons of Nūr-alīšu;
10. _igi_ sig-an-nu-ni-tum _dumu_ i-din-{d}er3-ra 
