12. _igi_ s,il2-li2-{d}utu _dumu_ {d}utu-be-la-ni 
#tr.ts: maḫar ṣilli-šamaš mār šamaš-bēlani
#tr.en: before Ṣilli-šamaš, son of Šamaš-bēlani;
