6. _sag-bi 1(disz)-kam-ma a-sza3_ <<ib-ni>> la-ma-sa3-ni _lukur_ {d}utu 
#tr.ts: rēssu maḫrûm eqel lama(s)sani nadīt šamaš
#tr.en: its first front is the field of Lamassani, nadītu of Šamaš
7. _dumu-munus_ {d}utu-ma-gir x [x] x [...] x 
#tr.ts: mārat šamaš-māgir ...
