#tr.en: Ilī-amtaḫar 
7. _in-szi-sa10_ 
#tr.en: bought; 
8. 5/6(disz) _gin2 ku3-babbar_ 
#tr.en: 5/6 shekel of silver 
9. _sa10 til-la-bi-sze3#_ 
#tr.en: as its full price 
10. _in#-na-an-la2_ 
#tr.en: he weighed out; 
11. [li]-ba#-am [u2]-t,i#-ib# 
#tr.en: he fully satisfied (him). 
$ rest broken 
