#tr.en: his favorite prince, 
7. in pa-ni-szu nam-ru-tim 
#tr.en: with his shining face, 
8. ha-di-isz 
#tr.en: happily 
9. ip-pa-al-sa6-ni 
#tr.en: he looked, 
10. szar-ru-tam da-ri2-tam2 
#tr.en: and everlasting kingship 
