26. ra-bi-isz lu-wa-er-ra-an-ni 
#tr.en: he greatly commanded me. 
27. i-nu-u4-mi-szu 
#tr.en: At that time, 
28. ha-am-mu-ra-pi2 
#tr.en: Hammurapi, 
29. _lugal_ da-num2 
#tr.en: the mighty king, 
30. _lugal_ ka2-dingir-ra{ki} 
#tr.en: king of Babylon, 
