14'. e2 azag ki igi nu-bar-re-da-sze3 i-ni-ib-ku4-ku4-[...] 
#tr.en: or who shall bring it into a cultically taboo house where it cannot be seen,   
15'. mu-sar-ra-ga2 szu bi2-ib2-ur3-ru-a mu-ni bi2-ib2-sar-[re-a] 
