#tr.en: Utu did not come forth in the sky, and the day was full of sorrow. 
>>Q000386 014 
15. ama dumu-ni-sze3 hul ti-la-e 
#tr.en: The mother, miserable because of her son, 
>>Q000386 015 
16. ama lugal-la ku3 {d}nin-sumun2-na a sza3-gu10 im-me 
