>>Q000388 018 
19. ur-{d}namma lugal uri5{ki}-ma nam du10 tar-ra-ba giri3 si mu-un-da-ab-sa2 
#tr.en: Under Ur-Namma, king of Urim, for whom a favorable destiny was determined, the roads have been made passable. 
>>Q000388 019 
