10. sza-li-im
#tr.ts: šalim
#tr.en: is fully satisfied.
11. u2-ul i-ta-ar-ma#
#tr.ts: ul itârma
#tr.en: (That) again
12. {disz}{d}utu-be-el-i3-li2#
#tr.ts: šamaš-bēl-ilī
#tr.en: Šamaš-bēl-ilī
13. a-na ni-id-nu-sza
#tr.ts: ana nidnuša
#tr.en: against Nidnuša
14. u2#-ul# i#-[ra]-ga-am
#tr.ts: ul ira(g)gam
#tr.en: will not raise a claim,
