11. u3 ip-qu2-an-nu-ni-tum ma-ri-szu 
#tr.ts: u ipqu-annunītum mārīšu
#tr.en: and Ipqu-annunītum his son,

12. {disz}ARAD2-{d}suen _dumu_ e-t,e-rum _{gesz}gag_ i-ma-ah-ha-as,-ma 
